sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as 'UI<br>Browser'
    participant JS as JavaScript (Frontend)
    participant API as Flask API (Routes)
    participant AM as ui.llcMgmt<br>(Middleware/Auth)
    participant UI as UI<br>(Orchestration)
    participant Bk as ledger.BookSvc<br>(llc/stmt)
    participant IRS as irs.Services<br>(Form Processing)
    participant DB as DB_Json<br>(⛁ OBJs/Profile)
    participant BookNS as BookNS<br>(⛁ Namespace Control)
    participant FM as Form.pdf<br>(⛁ namespece/FILL)
    participant U as Util (Log/Help)
    participant H as Bookkeeper (Logging/Helpers)

    Note over B, U: Request Phase
    B->>JS: User Action (e.g., Submit Form)
    JS->>API: Fetch Request (JWT/Headers)
    API->>AM: Validated Request
    AM->>UI: Log Request Initiation
    UI->>Bk: Service Book Action
    Bk->>IRS: irs.BookToIRS
    IRS->>Bk: get BookNS
    Bk->>DB: get book (GL) data
    Bk->>IRS: return book data
    IRS->>Bk: generate FillDict
    Bk->>BookNS: fetchBookNS/custom values
    IRS->>FM: fetch form NS from pdf
    IRS->>IRS: generate values bookNS X form fields
    IRS->>FM: output FILL.pdf
    Note over B, H: Response Phase
    IRS->>Bk: return code
    Bk->>UI: return success
    UI->>AM: return to view
    AM->>API: post return code
    API->>JS: return payload
    JS->>B: Update UI / Render ViewX
